            <div xml:id="d33">

                <pb facs="0056" n="44" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg44"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.90H/56a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-12-13T21:00:00-05:00">December 13,
                            1941—9 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>157. Please ascertain whether Afghan Government agreeable to establishment
                    Legation at Kabul. If no objection a Foreign Service Officer will probably be
                    appointed as Minister Resident and Consul General.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
